WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:08.730
<i>When I finally reached the Astral World, I started a Duel with Astral at stake with Eliphas, the highest being that represents this world!</i>

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:14.990
<i>I absolutely cannot lose this battle! I'm gonna bring it to 'im!</i>

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:18.580
The Duels of the strongest Duelists are ordained by inevitability!

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.950
Even the cards they draw are controlled by the Duelists themselves!

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.920
No way! That light...! It can't be!

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:29.920
Shining...Draw!!

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:35.380
Everything in the Dueling of Astral World consists of Shining Draws!

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:37.590
<i>All of them</i> are Shining Draws?!

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.760
Exactly! That is our Dueling!

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:47.270
I activate the Continuous Spell, Rank-Up Advantage, from my hand!

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:55.650
When I Special Summon an Xyz Monster using a Rank-Up Magic, this card allows me to draw one card!

00:00:55.650 --> 00:01:01.990
Additionally, when that Monster attacks, the effects of the opposing Monster in the battle are negated!

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:11.960
Then, this is the new Magic Card I drew via Shining Draw! Rank-Up Magic - Astral Force!

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.170
What?!

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:22.310
By targeting one Xyz Monster with the highest Rank on my field, this card Ranks-Up that Monster up to two Ranks!

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:25.060
He Ranked-Up two Ranks at once?!

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:29.770
I Overlay the Rank Four Etheric Anubis!

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:34.990
I rebuild the Overlay Network with this Monster!

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:37.200
Rank-Up Xyz Change!

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:46.710
Come forth, New Orders Rank 6! Etheric Apophis!

00:01:50.710 --> 00:02:02.010
At this moment, I activate Rank-Up Advantage's effect! When I Special Summon an Xyz Monster using a Rank-Up Magic, I can draw one card!

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:04.930
Shining Draw!

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:17.860
Then, I activate Etheric Apophis' effect! By detaching one Overlay Unit, it decreases one opposing Monster's Attack Power by 2000 points!

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.320
Hope's Attack Power was...!

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:24.830
I attack Hope with Etheric Apophis!

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.370
I activate Hope's effect!

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:33.250
It's useless! Due to Rank-Up Advantage's effect, Hope's effect was already negated!

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:37.710
If so, I activate a Trap! Half Unbreak!

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:43.890
This card protects a Monster from being destroyed by battle, and halves the damage the player takes!

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:53.480
I set one card, and end my turn!

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:00.150
Ryouga...no...Nasch.

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.820
It's time for your awakening!

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:02.950
What?

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:05.120
You must get your memories back!

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:06.870
My memories?

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.120
That's right.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:11.580
Nasch's memories are sleeping inside of you.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:15.590
To me, you are not Ryouga Kamishiro!

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:19.380
You are the leader of the Seven Barian Emperors, Nasch!

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:23.840
This place is...!

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:24.890
That's right.

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:28.850
These are the ruins where your memories and the girl's rest.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:33.940
And this belongs to the leader of the Seven Barian Emperors, Nasch!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:38.610
If this indeed belongs to you, it is certain to reveal the truth to you.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.700
Now please remember!

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:42.910
Nasch!

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:15.790
<i>Being best friends doesn't mean we always were</i>

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:18.840
<i>That's pretty much true</i>

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:26.300
<i>I found you during our serious battles</i>

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:29.850
<i>The other me inside myself</i>

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:34.730
<i>Awakening from within the conflict</i>

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:41.070
<i>A turn for a chance! Seize it! Draw!</i>

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:44.280
<i>Duel! Dualism!</i>

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:47.160
<i>These cards are polished to fit each other</i>

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:51.790
<i>My fated opponent is my heart reflected through the mirror</i>

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:54.870
<i>And if we end up with a "tie" in the end,</i>

00:04:54.870 --> 00:05:03.340
<i>when we fall, all covered with mud, we'll praise each other</i>

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.750
They're all Shining Draws...

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:21.380
Two Rank-Ups at once...!

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.380
So that's the Astral World's Dueling!

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:30.850
That's right. Only those who aim to Rank-Up can achieve such Dueling. It is the kind of Dueling which Astral should inherit.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:29.510
"A Transcendental State! The Threat of Double Rank-up!!"

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:34.850
But now Astral no longer has such qualifications.

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:44.280
Astral was as stubborn as you at the beginning, but after experiencing so many things with me, he has changed!

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.780
Then take a good look at Astral!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:55.660
That black shadow on the front of his chest... That's the scar you gave Astral!

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:02.130
<i>The evil stain that contaminated the heart of Astral will not disappear!</i>

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:05.590
In the beginning it's nothing but a small scar, however...

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:13.850
...starting from that wound, his body will eventually become fully intoxicated and his heart may die off.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:23.770
Astral...! Tch! That’s not the case! Astral won't die! That guy won't lose to some poison!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.740
How can you be so sure?

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:34.620
Listen, everyone of the entire Astral World is watching this Duel. So I suggest you make yourself clear.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:42.500
You are the one who implanted the poison named "chaos". You may think you have saved Ena and others, but you are sadly mistaken!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:49.880
They may seem fine for now, but sooner or later they will be conquered by the power you gave them, and suffer in pain!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:53.760
For us, the power of chaos is useless.

00:06:54.760 --> 00:07:00.100
All you're doing is running away! Why don't you fight?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:04.730
If you refuse to fight it out, aren't people in this whole world just weak?

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:12.450
If that's how you put it, what about your world? Because of chaos, many people are suffering, and continuously repeating their failures.

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:16.370
And precisely due to those reasons, it's a world that is unable to achieve Rank-Up, isn't it?

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:22.960
That's not the case! Even if we fail and we're crushed by our losses, we will definitely continue to challenge without giving up!

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:27.800
That's right! In our world, no matter who it is, everyone is capable of bringing it to 'em!

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:35.510
"Bringing it to 'em"... Words of chaos. Your father, Kazuma Tsukumo, said the same thing.

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:40.770
Dad? So my dad's really in the Astral World?

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:45.650
Essentially, his arrival to this world was already a mistake.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:52.280
He modified Astral's program to Earth without authorization, and made you encounter him.

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:59.370
If Kazuma Tsukumo didn't betray us, then Astral would not have been contaminated by Chaos!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.330
Where's my dad?!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:04.460
He is still alive, but without freedom, of course.

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:05.670
What'd you say?!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:07.550
And the same goes for them!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:19.930
Ena?! Why are you doing this to Ena and others?! It has nothing to do with them!

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:24.520
No! We cannot ignore anyone who has contacted chaos directly!

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:28.020
C'mon! Release them all!

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:31.030
Everything is at stake in this Duel.

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:31.820
Yuma...

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:37.870
If you manage to win, maybe this world's orientation of values will change accordingly as well.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:42.080
Well, it's not like you can defeat me in the first place.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:47.040
I will win! This Duel is a Duel I absolutely cannot afford to lose!

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:52.510
If this guy can do it, I can Shining Draw too!

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:59.010
That's a waste of time.

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:06.980
The reason you could achieve a Shining Draw was due to Astral's power, not your own!

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:17.620
Even so, my deck will respond to me! That's what Duel Monsters is! That's what it means to bring it to 'em!

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:20.660
My turn! Draw!

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.250
Here it comes, Eliphas!

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.000
What?

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:31.750
Mine and Astral's deck has responded to me! The card I created with Astral!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.920
I activate the Rank-Up-Magic, Numeron Force!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.720
What did you say?!

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:46.810
During this turn, this card negates the effects of cards face-up on the field, and Ranks Up one Xyz Monster I control to a Chaos Number!

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:51.110
I Overlay the Rank Four Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:55.610
I rebuild the Overlay Network with this Monster!

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:57.860
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:11.290
Come forth, Chaos Number 39! Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray Victory!

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:19.390
The power of chaos that has threatened this world...

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:22.100
I activate Hope Ray Victory's effect!

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:29.270
By detaching one Overlay Unit, during this turn, the Attack Power of the opposing Monster that battles this card will be added to this card!

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.610
Victory Charge!

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:37.030
It powers up with Etheric Apophis' 2500 Attack Points!

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:41.530
5300 Attack Points...

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:47.500
This is the hope I created together with Astral! Go, Hope Ray Victory!

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:51.290
Hope Sword Double Victory Slash!

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:03.390
Alright, I end my tur-

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:06.060
I activate a Trap! Ascension Spiral!

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:10.940
It Banishes the Xyz Monster in my Graveyard that was destroyed during the battle this turn,

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:16.690
and Special Summons an Xyz Monster that has two Ranks higher than the Banished Monster!

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.860
I Banish Etheric Apophis!

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:25.950
Come forth, New Orders Rank 8!

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:31.250
Etheric Sebek!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.050
Another Rank-Up?!

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:45.010
Continuously Ranking-Up... That is the state of mind the Astral World desires.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:51.230
I end my turn there! Also, Victory's Attack Power returns to normal!

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:56.940
My turn! I activate Astral Force's effect from my Graveyard!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:01.610
Instead of conducting a normal draw, I can add this card from my Graveyard to my hand!

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:04.570
He brought the Rank-Up card back to his hand?!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:12.790
I activate the Rank-Up Magic, Astral Force! I Overlay the Rank Eight Etheric Sebek!

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:17.630
I rebuild the Overlay Network with this Monster!

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:20.130
Rank-Up Xyz Change!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:28.760
Come forth, New Orders Rank Ten, Etheric Horus!

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.190
Also, I activate Rank-Up Advantage's effect!

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:49.200
When I Special Summon an Xyz Monster using a Rank-Up Magic, I can draw one card from my deck! Shining Draw!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:53.660
I have drawn the second Astral Force!

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.130
A-Astral Force again?!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:59.880
I activate Astral Force once again!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.630
D-Don't tell me...!

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:05.590
I Overlay the Rank Ten Etheric Horus!

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:10.140
I rebuild the Overlay Network with this Monster!

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.430
Rank-Up Xyz Change!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:16.810
Come forth, New Orders Rank 12!

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:27.910
Chaos, let the elegant Rank-Up purify your filthy soul! Etheric Maahes!!

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:34.830
Double-Rank-Up, not to mention Rank 12?!

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:42.090
Then I activate Rank-up Advantage's effect! Shining Draw!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:52.470
I activate Etheric Maahes’ effect! Once per turn, it Special Summons all Monsters that have become Overlay Units!

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:57.730
Come forth, Etheric Sebek! Horus!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:10.070
Three Xyz Monsters at once?!

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:19.630
Then I activate a Continuous Spell, Rank Domination! Thanks to this card's effect, all Monsters without Ranks cannot attack!

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:30.090
Also, the order of attacks begins from the Monster with lowest Rank! Go, Rank Eight Etheric Sebek! Attack Hope Ray Victory!

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:34.680
I won't let that happen! I activate Hope Ray Victory's effect!

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:42.820
By detaching one Overlay Unit during battle, it gains Attack Points equal to the same amount of the opposing Monster's Attack Points!

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:46.780
I activate Rank Domination’s second effect!

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:56.250
When two Monsters battle, for every difference of Rank between the Monsters, the Monster with the lower rank loses 1000 Attack Points!

00:14:56.250 --> 00:15:06.880
Hope Ray Victory is Rank Five, so its difference between my Monster is three! Therefore, Hope Ray Victory loses 3000 Attack Points!

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.300
Victory's Attack Power was...!

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:13.100
Go, Sebek! Seize victory by the teeth!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:23.150
But with this level of attack...! Numbers can only be destroyed by other Numbers, you know!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:28.610
In front of Rank-Up's elegant soul, even Numbers will be powerless!

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:29.240
What?!

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:32.410
Go, Rank Ten Etheric Horus!

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.910
At this moment, I activate Rank Domination's effect!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:47.210
The difference of Ranks between Etheric Horus and Hope Ray Victory is five! Thus, Victory loses 5000 Attack Points!

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:48.840
How can that be?!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:55.350
Alright, do it! Etheric Horus! Attack Hope Ray Victory!

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:06.320
My memories...

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:09.940
I have no idea why you and the girl ended up here on Earth.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:13.490
But we need you two!

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:16.240
I want you to confirm this with your own eyes!

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:17.870
Nasch!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:37.760
This is...the memory I saw before!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:43.310
Dear brother, my soul shall cleanse Abyss.

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:44.440
Rio...!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:52.110
Rio!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:56.410
<i>Dear brother, please guide this world!</i>

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.280
Blasphemy...!

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:02.620
The God was purified and disappeared!

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:05.250
Shit! Let's pull back for now!

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:13.880
Rio...!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:14.970
Rio...

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:19.260
How could this happen, my dear friend...?!

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:20.850
Rio...

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:26.850
RIO!

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:35.610
<i>Rio, I couldn't protect you.</i>

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:40.200
<i>Are these really our memories?</i>

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:48.130
<i>My memories...as Ryouga Kamishiro...ended on that day.</i>

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:52.460
<i>At that moment, inside me, Nasch...</i>

00:17:52.460 --> 00:18:00.930
<i>No, I am Nasch. These memories are definitely mine.</i>

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.930
<i>In that case...</i>

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:04.890
I will fight!

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.690
Sail out, my army!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:21.120
Vector, I will not forgive you! Even if it leads me to Hell, I will avenge Rio!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:32.500
Do it! Burn everything to cinders!

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.390
Reduce everything here to ashes!

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:47.350
Do not falter! Press forward!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.950
After him! Don't let him get away!

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:08.210
Vector! No matter where you run, I swear you'll...!

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:12.920
This is...

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.840
So cruel...

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:20.340
To think you'd actually destroy the city you fled to...Vector!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.020
R-Rio...?

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.110
Wait! I still have Life left!

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:41.820
Why are you still fighting even after all this?

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:46.030
Isn't that obvious? It's to save Astral!

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:49.040
Then take a good look at your Astral.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:51.000
Huh?

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:55.710
Because your Life was depleted, he is closer to disappearance.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:20:00.880
H-How can that be?! I won't let Astral vanish!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:08.720
Yuma Tsukumo, Astral's existence would indeed disappear now, But Astral is capable of resurrection.

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:09.810
What did you say?!

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:17.570
To eliminate all of his memories until now, and make Astral loyal to his mission of destroying Barian World!

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:19.280
Y-You can't...!

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:32.460
That's not Astral at all! Why don't you understand?! The feeling of protecting someone and living for the sake of someone?!

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:37.920
Have you considered what to do after getting back Astral?

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:38.920
Huh?

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:50.220
When the battle with the Barians concludes and we manage to find the Numeron Code, his mission is over. What are you planning to do then?

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:59.150
That innocent feeling of wanting to fight together with Astral will one day turn into the fear of losing Astral, won't it?

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:09.450
Then, that will become a large shackle. You will probably lose due to that reason, and that is precisely how foolish chaos is.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:16.580
I cannot entrust our world...to someone like you!

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:23.050
Go, Etheric Maahes, attack Hope Ray Victory!

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:29.010
At this moment, I activate Rank Domination's effect!

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:38.810
The difference of Ranks between Hope Ray Victory and Etheric Maahes is seven! Thus, Hope Ray Victory loses 7000 Attack Points!

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:43.190
No way! Its Attack Power became zero!

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:45.900
Farewell, Yuma Tsukumo!

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:55.620
Astral... I...

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:57.330
You...

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:00.790
Astral!

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:05.260
Huh?! That just now...! Don't tell me...!

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:09.470
Yuma!

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:23.900
<i>Is it the world that's boring?</i>

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:26.440
<i>Or maybe you're the one who's not gettin' serious?</i>

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:27.650
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:27.650 --> 00:22:29.070
<i>Do I understand?</i>

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:31.950
<i>Already got my answers</i>

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:34.450
<i>Once you start movin', you ain't stoppin'</i>

00:22:34.450 --> 00:22:37.000
<i>I go on thinkin' even while losin'.</i>

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:38.080
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:39.120
<i>I understand!</i>

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:42.500
<i>Our formula for reversal's already gathered</i>

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:44.840
<i>You afraid it ain't comin' true?</i>

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:47.970
<i>I gotta 'least give it a try</i>

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:50.180
<i>Ain't no problem if they say I'm borin'</i>

00:22:50.180 --> 00:22:53.180
<i>True failure's when we stop movin'</i>

00:22:53.350 --> 00:22:55.140
<i>Come on! Ga, ga, ga, guys & dolls</i>

00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:56.520
<i>Go, go, go, go my way</i>

